# Tests for Omarchy migrations that recognize stock config files by their
# Omarchy-branded content (exact text or sha256). After the rebrand that
# content can never match, and the migrations themselves only matter on
# systems older than v4.0.6, the release codeswotOS forked from: adoption
# runs every pending Omarchy migration first, and fresh installs are seeded
# as already migrated. test/shell skips the files listed here.
hyprland-default-config-test.sh
kitty-config-test.sh
opr-priority-migration-test.sh
